This is a placeholder for your PyTorch foundation style transfer model.

To enable neural/deep learning-based foundation application:
- Train or export a PyTorch model that takes (image, color, mask) as input and outputs a stylized image.
- Save the model as 'foundation_style_model.pt' in this backend directory.
- The backend will automatically load and use this model if present.

Example (Python):
torch.jit.save(your_traced_or_scripted_model, "foundation_style_model.pt")

If this file is missing, the backend will use classic (non-neural) blending logic.
